# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Enquiry form delivery
#
# The contact form validates and posts to /api/enquiry. Until one of the two
# options below is configured, the API responds honestly that nothing was
# delivered and the form tells the visitor to phone or WhatsApp instead —
# it never pretends an email was sent.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.local` (local) or set the same variables in your
# hosting provider's environment settings (production).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# OPTION 1 — Webhook. Works with Formspree, Zapier, Make, n8n, a CRM inbox,
# Google Apps Script, or any endpoint that accepts a JSON POST.
# ENQUIRY_WEBHOOK_URL=https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx

# OPTION 2 — Transactional email via Resend (https://resend.com).
# The "from" address must be on a domain you have verified with Resend.
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# ENQUIRY_TO_EMAIL=ronald@westsidetrading448.co.za
# ENQUIRY_FROM_EMAIL=website@westsidetrading448.co.za

# If both are set, the webhook wins.
